{{Saintapedia Graph examples}}

<code>format=raw</code> prints Mermaid instead of drawing. Use this while matching column names.

== Wikitext ==

<pre>
{{#saintapedia_graph:
tables=OrgDemo
|fields=_pageName=Name,ParentOrg,Type
|parent_field=ParentOrg
|node_id=Name
|format=raw
|limit=20
}}
</pre>

